---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Contact Potts Plumbing | North Georgia"
  description="Contact Potts Plumbing about home plumbing work in North Georgia by email or phone."
  currentPage="contact"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="interior-hero contact-hero">
      <div class="container interior-hero__grid">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact / Potts Plumbing</p>
        <div>
          <h1>A clear conversation is a good place to start.</h1>
          <p>Get in touch about a plumbing repair, an update, or a home project you are considering.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-start section-rule">
      <div class="container contact-start__grid">
        <aside class="contact-start__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
          <h2>Share the details that will help frame the conversation.</h2>
          <p>A brief note is enough to start a conversation about the work, next steps, and price.</p>
        </aside>
        <div class="contact-start__options">
          <div class="contact-option contact-option--email">
            <p class="eyebrow">Email</p>
            <a class="contact-option__primary" href="mailto:gtpservices212@gmail.com">gtpservices212@gmail.com</a>
            <p>The email link opens your email app. A few words about the project are enough to begin.</p>
            <a class="button-dark" href="mailto:gtpservices212@gmail.com">Send an email</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-option contact-option--phone">
            <p class="eyebrow">Phone</p>
            <a class="contact-option__primary" href="tel:+17706853901">(770) 685-3901</a>
            <p>Phone is available if that is more convenient.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-details section-tint">
      <div class="container contact-details__grid">
          <p class="eyebrow">Optional details</p>
        <div>
          <h2>A few details can help</h2>
          <p>No need to diagnose anything. Share as much or as little as you know; the conversation can clarify the next steps.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>What you have noticed, in a few words</li>
            <li>The room or fixture, if you know</li>
            <li>Your town, to help confirm availability</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
